{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04333","headline":"和苏员外寓直 · 乔知之","name":"和苏员外寓直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自昔重爲郎，伊人练国章。\n三旬登建礼，五夜直明光。\n墨草尚书奏，衣飘侍御香。\n开轩竹气静，拂簟蕙风凉。\n晓漏离阊阖，鸣钟出未央。\n从来宿台上，天子贵文强。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乔知之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}